        <mxCell id="question" parent="1" style="strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=16;strokeColor=#4C72B0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#1F2937;fontSize=20;fontFamily=Arial;fillColor=#F8FAFC;" value="&lt;b&gt;Question&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:9px;color:#374151&quot;&gt;Lloyd earns $10 an hour on Math tutoring. He tutored 5 hours for the first week and 8 hours for the second week. How much did he earn for the first two weeks?&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
